[ti:Day 11]

[00:00.00]outfit 例 All of these tourists are from the same outfit. 这些游客都来自同一个单位。
[00:06.81]emulator 例 Read the instructions before you use the latest version of the emulator as a big change has been made. 使用最新版仿真器之前请阅读使 用说明，因为这一代产品有很大变动。 international reply coupon 国际回信券；回邮代金券
[00:20.57]eventual 例 We'll make the eventual decision after getting your latest item catalogue. 拿到贵方最 新的商品目录后，我方将作出最后决定。
[00:31.38]embody 例 The company will provide more funding to produce new products that embody Chinese culture. 该公司将会投入更多资金去生产能体现中 国文化的新产品。
[00:43.82]facility 例 Some local officials say the fish market should be relocated from its crowded and aging facility. 一些地方官员认为鱼市应该迁离拥 挤的地方并更换老化的设备。
[00:57.29]handbill 例 He was distributing handbills when Amy caught her first glimpse of him. 埃米第一次看 见他时，他正在散发宣传单。
[01:07.51]admittance 例 The journalist managed to get admittance to the manager's offices. 那个记者成功得到了 进入经理办公室的许可。
[01:17.58]intrigue 例 It is uncomfortable to work in a company full of suspicion and intrigue. 在一个充满猜疑 和阴谋的公司里工作很不舒服。
[01:27.79]formal 例 We have no formal collaboration until now. 在此之前，我们没有正式合作过。
[01:34.16]aggregate 例 These aggregate statistics concealed in fact the severe income disparities. 这些总的统 计数据实际上掩盖了收入的巨大差距。
[01:45.41]deficiency 例 The Chinese government has to deal with some deficiencies in its business environment as infrastructure, education, etc. 中国政府必须 应对本国商业环境的一些不足，如基础设施、教 育等。
[02:02.44]contest 例 Her withdrawal from the contest was a tactical manoeuvre. 她退出比赛是一个战术策 略。
[02:10.87]budget 例 The Ministry of Finance consistently overestimated its budget deficits. 财政部一贯 高估预算赤字。
[02:21.24]defeat 例 Don't be too upset. Just remember that today's defeat will be the preface to our successor's victory. 别太沮丧了。只要记住：今 天的失败将是我们后继者成功的开端。
[02:34.86]hazard 例 The rating agency is believed to have allowed a kind of moral hazard to creep into their organisation. 人们认为该信用评级机构已经 让某种程度的道德风险渗透到其机构中去。
[02:48.48]depress 例 The campaign against waste of food will depress food prices in the CPI by 2.5 percentage points. 这场反对食品浪费的活动将 使食品价格在CPI中的比重下降2.5个百分点。
[03:01.51]critical 例 Regardless of whether you have taken venture capital or not, capital efficiency and bootstrapping are critical values. 不考虑你是否 已参与风险投资，资金的有效性和引导指令都具 有决定性价值。
[03:17.94]proposition 例 This is obviously a paying proposition. 这笔 生意显然很赚钱。
[03:24.75]ill-mannered 例 Ill-mannered taxi drivers are hardly unknown in the US. 在美国，态度恶劣的出租车 司机并非罕见。
[03:33.64]insufficient 例 We soon realised that we had insufficient money to fund the project. 我们很快意识到我们 没有足够的资金来投资这个项目。
[03:44.00]intermediation 例 This rapid growth in the bank sector did not improve the quality of financial intermediation. 银行业的高速增长并未改善金融 中介的质量。
[03:57.92]legitimate 例 In order to achieve its legitimate purpose, the company must carry forward the project in a certain procedure. 为了达到合法目的，公司必 须按照一定的流程推进这个项目。
[04:13.32]prevail 例 The new rule ensures that only the most senior staff prevail. 新规则确保只有最资深的员 工才能胜出。
[04:22.05]worthiness 例 They have introduced a credit-worthiness assessment and reward system for small businesses. 他们为小型企业引进了一套信贷价值 评估及奖励制度。
[04:35.52]pastime 例 Listening to music or reading is the favourite pastime of many people after work. 听听音乐或者看看书是许多人工作之余最喜爱的 消遣。
[04:46.78]wholesale 例 Social change is difficult, and some projects are bound to fall short of what is expected. 社会变革是困难的，因此有些项目难 免达不到预期目标。
[04:59.36]assign 例 The business analyst can assign resources and durations reasonably to each of the tasks in the process. 业务分析师能够将资源和时间合 理地分配给正在进行中的每一项任务。
[05:13.28]analysis 例 Statistical analysis is a means of arriving at a fairly reliable forecast. 统计分析是一种相当可 靠的预测方法。
[05:23.94]venue 例 It is not so easy here to find an ideal venue for business meetings. 在这儿找一个理想的商 务会议地点没有那么容易。
[05:32.97]census 例 He then compared it with the census of 1881. 他将这些数据同1881年的人口普查数据进行 了对比。
[05:39.33]meticulous 例 He made meticulous preparations so as to display his ability to the interviewers. 他一丝不 苟地准备着，为的是在面试官面前展示自己的能 力。
[05:51.18]ferry 例 If you want tickets for the ferry, please fill in this booking form. 如果你想买渡船的票, 请填
[06:00.36]know-how 例 The company has the know-how to solve these problems. 该公司拥有解决这些难题的专门 技能。
[06:08.35]dotcom 例 There are great differences between today and the dotcom bubble of about two decades ago. 今天的情况与大约二十年前的互联网泡沫非 常不同。
[06:20.49]inactive 例 The company was inactive after being struck by the economic crisis. 经过经济危机的 重创后，该公司几乎停业。
[06:30.26]notify 例 Please notify him that the press conference has been postponed until next Tuesday. 请通 知他新闻发布会推迟到了下周二。
[06:41.66]emigrate 例 He emigrated from India to Norway to enjoy a better life. 为了拥有更好的生活，他从印度移 民到了挪威。
[06:49.96]consent 例 Any concessions would have required the consent of all the lenders. 谈判中的任何妥协都 应得到所有出借方的同意。
[06:59.58]engine 例 A team leader to a team is like an engine to a car. 团队领导者在团队中的作用堪比引擎对于 汽车的作用。
[07:06.39]defalcate 例 Nobody can defalcate the property of the company by abusing their power. 任何人不得滥 用职权，挪用公司财产。
[07:16.90]appeal 例 That venture company holds little appeal for me. 对我来说，那家合资企业几乎没什么吸引 力。
[07:24.01]jog 例 His business just kept jogging along for years. 多年来他的生意一直平平。
[07:30.52]index 例 You can see the materials about these companies on the index page. 你可以在索引页 面看到这些公司的相关资料。
[07:39.55]haggle 例 In many countries you have to haggle before you buy anything. 在许多国家，买东西 之前都得讨价还价。
[07:48.14]handset 例 The margins of handset makers were controlled by the telecom carriers. 手机制造商 的利润被电信运营商所控制。
[07:58.21]cosmopolitan 例 The downside of being so cosmopolitan is that European jobs may migrate to low-cost countries. 世界主义的一个负面效应就是欧洲的 工作岗位可能会向低成本国家迁移。
[08:11.98]entertainment 例 It's good to have some entertainment after a long time at work. 长时间工作后找点娱乐有好 处。
[08:21.75]demonstrate 例 You need to demonstrate more wisdom to take full advantage of every opportunity and solve the company's problems. 你需要展示出更 多智慧，充分利用各种机会解决公司存在的问 题。
[08:37.74]essential 例 The financial reform is essential to facilitate the future industrial restructuring. 对 于今后的产业重建，金融改革势在必行。
[08:50.17]deceit 例 The case was described as a web of greed and deceit that reflected Wall Street's trading scandal existing for a long time. 该事件被描述 成一张欲望和欺骗交织的网。它揭示了存在已久 的华尔街交易丑闻。
[09:06.16]incumbent 例 The incumbent should first do something meaningful and then insist on it. 在职者应该做 一些有意义的事并坚持下去。
[09:16.82]admiration 例 With his own wisdom and honesty, he earned the admiration of all his colleagues. 凭 借自己的智慧和诚实，他赢得所有同事的钦佩。
[09:28.37]absolve 例 Mr. Anderson's admirable behaviour in the aftermath of the attacks does not absolve him of responsibility for negligence. 安德森先生在 袭击之后的可敬行为并不能免除他的过失责任。
[09:44.95]intranet 例 The people who do not work for your company can't access such information through your intranet. 不是你公司的员工就无法 通过你们的内部网看到这些信息。
